    uco-core:description "Layer 1 of the web_search_history derivation: Read bitstream from forensic image container file(s) (DFT-1043). Tool(s) as run: dissect. dissect decoded the EWF container inside the delegated browser call, as a black box — the decode was not separately observed or timed. marple2 can decode EWF independently through pyewf (the libyal path), but that did not run for this result." .

